{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>葵涌一間中學有五名學生被墜下的石屎擊中，輕傷送院。</p><p></p><p>現場是安捷街裘錦秋中學，警方上午10時許接報，有五名學生被石屎擊中受輕傷，送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。調查指，校內正進行升降機工程。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:43:50.648707+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T10:57:12.328919+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T10:37:14.855320+00:00","content_hash":"fb5d84e6aab0f7ffa816406368ddbab5b6bb68465f5e4bb54d265e726e803f92","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:43:50.648707+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}